<title>UK: Bayer Hypo adds 100 mln lire to five-year bond.</title>
<headline>Bayer Hypo adds 100 mln lire to five-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond has been increased to 300 bln lire from 200 bln lire, joint lead managers Cariplo and IMI Lux.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BAYERISCHE HYPOTHEKENBANK</p>
<p> AMT   *300 BLN LIRE  COUPON     7.10	MATURITY    17.JUN.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.575   PAY DATE  L-16.JUN.97</p>
<p>MOODY/S&amp;P AA2/A+</p>
<p> NOTES     *ORIGINALLY LAUNCHED FOR 200 BLN LIRE ON 13.MAY.97</p>
<p>		PAR CALL ON 17.JUN.99</p>
<p>		L-LONG FIRST COUPON</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
